B.bqn=s(["Tap one: a record opens already filled in.","Check the amount, the day and the source, then press Save: that also marks the share paid, the turn collected or the income received."],t.s)
B.aku=new A.dg("pay_or_collect","Pay or collect","What is due now and in the next 30 days: gameya shares and turns, bills, installments and expected income, in To pay and To collect.",B.bqn)
B.buM=s(["Point the camera at the receipt and take the picture.","Check what was read (amount, date, shop, source) and correct it.","Press Save."],t.s)
B.ajS=new A.dg("scan_receipt","Scan a receipt","The camera, to take a picture of a receipt; Thara reads it into a record form.",B.buM)
B.bFr=s(["Say the amount, what it was and the source.","Check the filled form and press Save."],t.s)
B.ak2=new A.dg("speak_record","Say a record",'The record form, listening: the user says the record ("I paid 250 for lunch from cash") and the form is filled from it.',B.bFr)
B.bHa=s(["Type a question or a record in the box at the bottom and send it.","Drafts appear as cards with Save, Edit or Cancel."],t.s)
B.ajQ=new A.dg("chat","Ask Thara (chat)","The typed chat with Thara AI: questions about the wallet, drafts of records and plans, and answers to anything.",B.bHa)
B.bcT=s(["Type the source name.","Choose its type and currency.","Type the opening balance: what it holds today.","Count in net worth is on by default; turn it off for money the user only looks after.","Press Save source."],t.s)
B.ajP=new A.dg("new_source","New source","Adds a place money is kept: cash, a bank account, a card, a wallet or savings. Every record belongs to a source.",B.bcT)
B.bLu=s(["Type the name and the amount.","Set the next due date and how it repeats.","Choose the payment source (or leave it to be asked each time).","Press Save obligation. It then shows under Due."],t.s)
B.ajG=new A.dg("new_bill","New bill or debt","A new obligation: rent, a loan, a subscription, a bill, with its amount and next due date, once or repeating.",B.bLu)
B.bsD=s(["Type the name and the target.","Optionally pick a target date.","Choose the sources that hold the money, so its progress follows their balance.","Press Save goal."],t.s)
B.ajN=new A.dg("new_goal","New savings goal","A goal to save for: a name, a target amount and an optional date, and the sources that hold the money for it.",B.bsD)
B.bIO=s(["Check or change the amount.","Choose the source the money comes from.","Press Save."],t.s)
B.ak5=new A.dg("add_to_goal","Add to my goal","Money towards the main goal: a transfer into the source that holds it, with the next step's amount filled in. With no goal yet it opens the goal editor.",B.bIO)
B.boB=s(["Type the list name and press Save list.","Add items with a name and, if known, a price."],t.s)
B.ak1=new A.dg("new_shopping_list","New shopping list","A new shopping list, opened once it is named.",B.boB)
B.bFf=s(["Tap a plan to read it, then start it.","Fill in its settings and save; it then measures each week or month."],t.s)
B.ak7=new A.dg("new_budget_plan","Choose a plan","The catalog of plans to start: budgets (50/30/20, by category, an expense plan), saving plans (pay yourself first, 52-week challenge, daily saving and more), an emergency fund, debt payoff, zakat and others.",B.bFf)
B.bq2=s(["Type the name and the amount.","Choose the source and the payday.","Press Save schedule."],t.s)
B.ajH=new A.dg("new_payday","New expected income","An income schedule: a name, an amount, the source it arrives in and the payday each month. On that day Thara asks whether it arrived; nothing is recorded before the user confirms.",B.bq2)
B.bIM=s(["Type the circle name and the contribution.","Set weekly or monthly, the start, the members and the user's turn.","Choose the payment source.","Press Save circle."],t.s)
B.akx=new A.dg("new_gameya","Set up a gameya","A new savings circle (gameya): how much everyone pays, how often, and which turn the user collects.",B.bIM)
B.bFS=s(["Type the name, the weight and pick the karat.","Optionally what was paid (Thara can then record the purchase).","Press Save holding."],t.s)
B.ako=new A.dg("new_gold","Add a gold piece","A gold holding: a name, its weight in grams and its karat, valued at the recorded gold price.",B.bFS)
B.b4t=s(["Tap a source to see its details and recent records; from there add a record, a transfer, or edit it.","Add source adds a new one; Hide archived shows or hides old ones.","Balance check compares a source with the balance the user sees in their bank."],t.s)
B.akc=new A.dg("sources","Sources","Every source with its balance, and assets minus debt.",B.b4t)
B.bLx=s(["Read it; Open the full statistics leads to Analysis."],t.s)
B.ak8=new A.dg("wealth_summary","Wealth summary","What the user owns less what they owe: money held in sources, gold at the recorded price, debt sources, and the split by kind of source and by currency, plus this month's income, spending and what is left over.",B.bLx)
B.bsP=s(["Choose the source.","Type the observed balance and compare.","If they differ, Record the difference adds a record for it."],t.s)
B.ajW=new A.dg("balance_check","Check a balance","Reconciles a source: the user types the balance they really see, and Thara compares it with its own.",B.bsP)
B.bKz=s(["Pick This month, This year or Other dates at the top.","Read the figures and their change from before.","Tap a chart name to switch charts; tap a type to see its records.","More analysis opens the full statistics."],t.s)
B.ajM=new A.dg("analysis","Analysis","Statistics: spending, income, savings rate and spending per day for this month, this year or other dates, and charts (cash flow, net worth, categories, sources, days, budget, biggest).",B.bKz)
B.btE=s(["Tap a payment to see it; mark it paid from there (a record is made), skip it, or undo a payment.","New obligation adds a bill or debt."],t.s)
B.akC=new A.dg("due","Due","Bills, installments and recurring payments coming due, with what is overdue.",B.btE)
B.bj8=s(["Tap a waiting message to review the record Thara read in it.","Add it as a record, or dismiss it.","All messages shows every message; How far back picks the time.","Import settings choose what is read."],t.s)
B.akr=new A.dg("bank_messages","Bank messages","Bank, wallet and InstaPay text messages Thara read on the phone, as suggested records waiting for review; nothing is recorded by itself unless the user switched auto-record on.",B.bj8)
B.bsw=s(["Tap one to edit, archive, merge or delete it.","Add category: type a name, choose its kind and icon, Save category."],t.s)
B.akp=new A.dg("categories","Categories","The types (categories) records are labelled with, for spending and income, each with an icon and an optional monthly limit.",B.bsw)
B.bzS=s(["Add piece adds a holding.","Tap a piece to edit it, or record a sale (it opens an income record).","The gold price is set under Exchange rates."],t.s)
B.akw=new A.dg("gold","Gold holdings","Gold pieces with their weight, purity and today's value at the recorded gold price.",B.bzS)
B.bzb=s(["Tap a goal to see its pace, milestones and the records that moved it; from there Add to goal, edit, pause or make it the main goal.","New goal adds one."],t.s)
B.akh=new A.dg("goals","Goals","Savings goals, the main goal first: saved so far, what is left, the pace needed each week or month, and the saving plan feeding them.",B.bzb)
B.byb=s(["Tap a plan to open it: its targets, its lines and what is over or under, with Settings to change it, pause, resume or finish it.","Find a plan opens the catalog."],t.s)
B.ajR=new A.dg("plans","My plans","The user's budget and saving plans: the active one with what is left to spend or to set aside, plans that need attention, and the rest.",B.byb)
B.bw_=s(["Choose the start and end dates.","Read the net worth on the end date and the payments, goals and income included."],t.s)
B.ajO=new A.dg("outlook","Cash flow outlook","A projection: how recurring payments, expected income and goals due change the money available and the net worth between two dates.",B.bw_)
B.bEJ=s(["When a payday comes, answer Has it arrived?: confirming writes the income record (or uses one already in the ledger).","New adds a schedule; tap one to edit it."],t.s)
B.akz=new A.dg("income","Expected income","Income that is scheduled to come in, like a salary, with the next one expected and whether it arrived.",B.bEJ)
B.byh=s(["Tap a debt source to see it.","New purchase plans an installment purchase."],t.s)
B.ak9=new A.dg("owed","What I owe","Debts: the total owed, what is due this month, debt sources (cards, loans) and installment plans.",B.byh)
B.bDN=s(["Type the purchase price and the payment details the page asks for.","Save purchase adds a debt source for what is financed, a record of the purchase, and the monthly payment under Due."],t.s)
B.ak3=new A.dg("installments","Installment purchase","Plans a purchase paid in installments: compares the down payment with the monthly commitment and the true cost.",B.bDN)
B.brU=s(["Create a family account or join one with an invitation.","Tap an account to see its records and members; records waiting for the user show at the top."],t.s)
B.ajJ=new A.dg("family","Family accounts","Shared ledgers with people the user trusts: shared sources, members, their limits and their records. Needs a Thara account.",B.brU)
B.bCq=s(["Tap a circle to see what the user owes or is owed.","Record a contribution, or Collect payout on the user's turn.","Create a Gameya, or join one with an invitation code from its organizer."],t.s)
B.akv=new A.dg("gameya","Gameya","Savings circles: the next contribution, the expected payout and the turns.",B.bCq)
B.bIm=s(["Check the amounts filled in from the wallet and add what is missing.","Type a gold price per gram if none is recorded.","Read the zakat due. It is an estimate, not a ruling."],t.s)
B.akt=new A.dg("zakat","Zakat calculator","Estimates zakat: cash, gold, business and other assets less debts, against the nisab worked out from the gold price.",B.bIm)
B.bIb=s(["Tap a list; tick what was picked up.","Add an item with its name and price.","Review purchase turns the ticked items into an expense in the record form; it is saved only on Save.","Create a list adds a new one; a list can remind at a day and time."],t.s)
B.akq=new A.dg("shopping","Shopping lists","Shopping lists with items and prices; checked items become a draft expense when paid.",B.bIb)
B.bxg=s(["Search, or browse the library.","Tap an article to read it (about three minutes); Try it opens a calculator."],t.s)
B.ajI=new A.dg("learn","Learn","The library: short articles on building wealth, collections, saving articles and calculators with worked examples.",B.bxg)
B.bAf=s(["Tap an article to read it."],t.s)
B.ak0=new A.dg("saving_articles","Saving articles","Thara's articles about saving money.",B.bAf)
B.bIa=s(["Tap a currency or the gold price to type today's rate."],t.s)
B.akm=new A.dg("rates","Exchange rates","The base currency every amount is valued in, and the prices used for foreign money and gold.",B.bIa)
B.byA=s(["Tap one to open what it is about.","Reminder settings choose what reaches the lock screen and when."],t.s)
B.ak6=new A.dg("notifications","Notifications","The inbox of reminders and items to review, newest first.",B.byA)
B.bJU=s(["Review a lesson, or delete one or all."],t.s)
B.akn=new A.dg("scanner_lessons","Scanner lessons","Corrections the receipt scanner learned from the user, per shop.",B.bJU)
B.bd2=s(["Tap a row to change that setting; it applies at once."],t.s)
B.akA=new A.dg("preferences","Appearance & language","The user's name, language (English or Arabic), light or dark look, base currency, Arabic digits, hide amounts and motion effects.",B.bd2)
B.bLe=s(["Pick a size; the preview shows how it looks."],t.s)
B.akg=new A.dg("font","Font","The text size and font used in the app.",B.bLe)
B.bfM=s(["Press Add beside a widget, then confirm on the home screen.","Or: hold an empty spot on the home screen, choose Widgets, find Thara and drag one into place."],t.s)
B.ajU=new A.dg("home_widgets","Home screen widgets","Widgets for the phone's home screen: New record, Goals & plans, Shopping & goals, and what they may show.",B.bfM)
B.bEY=s(["Turn App lock on and choose a PIN of 4 digits.","Choose how soon it asks again.","Backup & restore and Device permissions are linked from here."],t.s)
B.akB=new A.dg("security","Privacy & app lock","The app lock (a PIN of 4 digits, and the fingerprint where the phone has one) and how long Thara may stay in the background before asking again. A forgotten PIN is reset from the lock screen through the Thara account (password, Google or a code by email); nothing is erased.",B.bEY)
B.baR=s(["Switch each kind on or off; Remind me at picks the hour."],t.s)
B.aks=new A.dg("reminders","Reminders","Which reminders reach the lock screen, with a preview, and at what hour.",B.baR)
B.bIV=s(["Tap a permission to allow it, or to open the phone settings."],t.s)
B.akk=new A.dg("permissions","Device permissions","Camera, microphone, messages and notifications: what Thara may use on the phone. Thara asks for each only when it is needed; taking one back is done in the phone's settings.",B.bIV)
B.bFj=s(["Switch each permission on or off.",'When a tool answers "not allowed", this is where the user allows it.'],t.s)
B.ak_=new A.dg("ai_permissions","Assistant permissions","What Thara AI may read and change (records, adding records, and more), and what goes online.",B.bFj)
B.byR=s(["Tap a fact to read, change or forget it."],t.s)
B.akd=new A.dg("memory","Assistant memory","The facts Thara remembers about the user, because they asked it to.",B.byR)
B.brm=s(["Choose where the voice is heard.","Check the connection to see that a talk can start."],t.s)
B.ajZ=new A.dg("live_settings","Live talk settings","Talking live: the switch, where Thara's voice is heard (phone speaker, headset or Bluetooth), the microphone, and a connection check.",B.brm)
B.bux=s(["Add your name, or add and verify an email.","Change password, or sign out."],t.s)
B.akl=new A.dg("profile","Your profile","Everything personal: the name, the email (verify it with the code Thara emails), how the user signs in, email reports, currency and language, what Thara remembers and what Thara AI may use.",B.bux)
B.bvi=s(["Sync now saves at once (it also happens by itself after changes).","Kept versions can bring back an earlier version.","Sign in, sign out, or delete the account."],t.s)
B.aki=new A.dg("account","Your Thara account","Where the wallet is kept: the Thara account it syncs with, when it was last saved, kept versions, and signing in or out.",B.bvi)
B.bEQ=s(["Choose weekly or monthly, and see the preview."],t.s)
B.ajL=new A.dg("email_reports","Email reports","Balances sent to the user's email, weekly or monthly, with a preview of what is sent.",B.bEQ)
B.aSz=s(["Back up now saves an encrypted backup.","Restore a backup checks what it holds, then replaces this ledger.","Google Drive: sign in to keep backups in the user's own Drive."],t.s)
B.aky=new A.dg("backups","Backups","Extra encrypted copies besides the Thara account: automatic backups to a folder, Google Drive, backing up now and restoring. Every backup is locked with the Thara account: no passphrase or recovery code; signing in on any phone opens it. Only an older backup asks for its key file, recovery code or passphrase.",B.aSz)
B.bHr=s(["Choose the folder and how often."],t.s)
B.ak4=new A.dg("backup_folder","Backup folder & schedule","Where automatic copies go and how often; they are locked with the Thara account.",B.bHr)
B.bGc=s(["Tap a topic, or go through all of it in order with Next and Previous."],t.s)
B.akb=new A.dg("guide","How to","The guide: each part of the app with a picture of its screen and the steps to follow.",B.bGc)
B.bI8=s(["Read the list; it helps when reporting a problem."],t.s)
B.ajV=new A.dg("problems","Problems","What went wrong on this phone (errors and freezes), kept on the phone.",B.bI8)
B.br0=s(["Check for an update from here."],t.s)
B.ajK=new A.dg("about","About Thara","What Thara is, this build, and whether a newer version is available.",B.br0)
