B.bRB={[u.cO]:0,[u.dj]:1,[u.dr]:2,"Continue on this phone for now":3,[u.hg]:4,[u.B]:5,"On this phone":6,"Keep this phone's":7,[u.eW]:8,[u.g3]:9,[u.al]:10,[u.ei]:11,[u.eC]:12,[u.aH]:13,[u.b6]:14,"Use it on this phone":15,[u.f3]:16,[u.bK]:17,[u.fd]:18,[u.eN]:19,[u.bj]:20,[u.fN]:21,[u.fo]:22,[u.A]:23,[u.Y]:24,[u.di]:25,[u.h]:26,[u.do]:27,[u.cv]:28,"Back to the phone's font":29,[u.r]:30,"Blocked in the phone\u2019s settings":31,[u.bL]:32,"Phone settings":33,"This account has no password, Google or email to prove it is you with. The only way forward is to erase this phone and sign in again afterwards.":34,"Erase this phone":35,Phone:36,"Phone setting":37,"The phone's language":38,"Anyone holding this phone unlocked can open Thara.":39,"Camera, microphone and messages":40,"Camera, microphone, messages, notifications":41,"Thara asks for each one only when you use what needs it. Taking one back is done in the phone\u2019s settings.":42,"On this phone only":43,[u.dh]:44,[u.fw]:45,"Who can open Thara on this phone":46,"Your settings on this phone":47,[u.fP]:48,"Restoring replaces the ledger on this phone. The backup itself is never changed.":49,"Replacing removes everything now in Thara and puts the backup in its place, in one step. Your lock and backup settings on this phone stay as they are.":50,"Thara keeps your money in one place: what you hold, what you spend and earn, what is due, and what you are saving for. Your wallet is kept in an encrypted ledger on this phone, behind your lock, and in your Thara account: encrypted in Thara's cloud, where Thara keeps its key safe so you can always get back in with your email or Google.":51,"File and Google Drive backups":52}
B.bPD=new A.az(B.bRB,["Record, review and plan \u2014 in this browser, and in your Thara account.","Thara keeps your wallet in your Thara account, sealed with the account\u2019s key before it leaves this browser. Any other device gets it back with your email and password, or with Google; this browser keeps a working copy.","You signed out. Your wallet was removed from this browser and is safe in your Thara account. Sign in to bring it back.","Continue in this browser for now","Your wallet starts in this browser, and Thara asks you to set up the account when its cloud can be used.","This browser and your Thara account each hold a wallet. Choose the one to keep. The other is saved as a file backup first, so nothing is lost.","In this browser","Keep this browser's","Sign in or create your account, and the wallet in this browser is saved to it. Any other device gets it back with your email and password, or with Google. This browser keeps a working copy.","Nothing is lost: your wallet stays in this browser, and Thara asks again when its cloud can be used.","Thara's cloud is not ready yet. Your wallet works in this browser meanwhile, and nothing is lost.","Thara's online service is switched off for now. Your wallet works in this browser meanwhile; try again later.","Thara's cloud has reached today's limit for everyone. It opens again tomorrow; your wallet works in this browser meanwhile.","Thara could not save a file backup in this browser first, so nothing was replaced. Try again.","Your wallet is in this browser now. You can make changes.","Use it in this browser","Your wallet is in this browser only for now: Thara's cloud is not ready yet. Nothing is lost.","Your wallet is in this browser only for now. Thara asks again when its cloud can be reached.","Not signed in. Your wallet is in this browser only.","Waiting for internet. Changes stay in this browser until then.","Thara's online service is switched off for now. Changes stay in this browser, and Thara tries again later.","Thara's cloud has a problem on its side right now. Changes stay in this browser, and Thara tries again soon.","Thara's cloud is not ready yet. Your wallet is kept in this browser meanwhile.","Sign out and remove the wallet from this browser?","Thara first makes sure your account has everything from this browser. Then it signs out and removes the wallet from this browser: its records, sources, settings and lock. Your wallet stays in your Thara account; sign in again to get it back. Backup files you downloaded stay where you saved them.","Your Thara account and the wallet in it were deleted. The wallet in this browser stays.","After a last sync; removes the wallet from this browser","Your wallet is kept encrypted in your account, and saved there after every change. This browser keeps a working copy.","On top of the text size this browser is set to.","Back to the standard font","The microphone is blocked in the browser\u2019s settings for Thara\u2019s site, so Thara cannot hear you yet. Allow it under Microphone below.","Blocked in the browser\u2019s settings","The browser no longer asks. Allow the microphone for Thara\u2019s site in the browser\u2019s settings.","Browser settings","This account has no password, Google or email to prove it is you with. The only way forward is to erase Thara in this browser and sign in again afterwards.","Erase Thara in this browser","System","System setting","The system's language","Anyone who can use this browser can open Thara.","Camera and microphone","Camera, microphone, notifications","Thara asks for each one only when you use what needs it. Taking one back is done in the browser\u2019s settings for Thara\u2019s site.","In this browser only",'Thara\'s cloud is not ready yet, so there is no account to sign in to. Your profile lives in this browser meanwhile; "Your Thara account" below checks again.',"You are not signed in. Your name and choices are in this browser only. Sign in or create your Thara account to keep your wallet in it, reset a password by email and get email reports.","Who can open Thara in this browser","Your settings in this browser","In an account you are a member of, the records are listed with your own under All, tagged \u201cFamily sharing\u201d. They move the family\u2019s sources, so they are not part of your own balances.","Restoring replaces the ledger in this browser. The backup itself is never changed.","Replacing removes everything now in Thara and puts the backup in its place, in one step. Your lock and backup settings in this browser stay as they are.","Thara keeps your money in one place: what you hold, what you spend and earn, what is due, and what you are saving for. In this browser your wallet is kept in the browser\u2019s storage for Thara\u2019s site, behind your lock, and in your Thara account: sealed before it leaves this browser and encrypted in Thara's cloud, where Thara keeps its key safe so you can always get back in with your email or Google.","Backup files"],t.l)
